cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use plumb-line, please cite it as below."
title: "plumb-line"
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Aoife
    family-names: Okonedo Martin
    alias: effythealien
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0005-8961-9647"
repository-code: "https://github.com/slopstopper/plumb-line"
license: Apache-2.0
keywords:
  - provenance
  - epistemic-honesty
  - taint-tracking
  - data-lineage
  - claude-code-plugin
abstract: >-
  A provenance library (JavaScript + Python) and Claude Code plugin that keeps
  a codebase epistemically honest: every value carries source, confidence, and
  lineage in a metadata envelope, combined under a conservative law so that
  mock or low-confidence data cannot be silently laundered into
  confident-looking outputs.
